Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.59,0:00:31.88,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.18,0:00:34.85,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.01,0:00:37.81,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.10,0:00:40.99,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to know what
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.99,0:00:43.95,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.34,0:00:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.95,0:00:46.98,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.98,0:00:50.00,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.00,0:00:52.32,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}All I want! Only you!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.32,0:00:56.21,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how immersive this game may be,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.21,0:00:58.70,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Aren't you way too into it?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.70,0:01:00.33,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If I do it differently,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.33,0:01:02.17,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}there won't be a happy ending
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.17,0:01:04.58,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}What nonsense are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:04.77,0:01:08.09,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}My wildest fantasies became my reality…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.09,0:01:10.59,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Ah, cool! You're cool! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.84,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Bringing such disruption to my once peaceful days…
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.18,0:01:16.60,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.81,0:01:18.47,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Love and hate both,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:18.47,0:01:24.71,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Without a partner, those feelings can never start!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.35,0:01:27.32,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So raise your hands!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.32,0:01:31.11,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Tentakushin wa Dede hitotsu dei Kocoro
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.11,0:01:36.07,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.07,0:01:37.95,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}from the bottom of your heart, hold up and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kara hold up Raise your\Nhands Kukukuku naai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:37.95,0:01:40.70,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Raise your hands! Surrender already!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.66,0:01:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your hands Melia te de fangai Raise
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.70,0:01:44.00,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! Throw 'em up and celebrate!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.00,0:01:46.79,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.30,0:01:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hands, Mou yai. Raise\Nyour hands, Iiisakai.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.79,0:01:49.42,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.42,0:01:53.30,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I won't give up until you tell me what you're planning!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.30,0:01:56.14,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}You're so awesome! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.32,0:01:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Omoshiroi desu. I love you.
