Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.01,0:02:03.02,Signs_EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fnMasqualero\fs180\an8\blur0.8\bord0\b1\pos(960,360)\c&H5B595E&}The {\c&H5151DF&}Villainess{\c&H5B595E&} and I {\c&H5151DF&}A{\c&H5B595E&}re {\c&H5151DF&}i{\c&H5B595E&}n {\c&H5151DF&}L{\c&H5B595E&}o{\c&H5151DF&}v{\c&H5B595E&}e
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I misjudged you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.34,0:02:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.44,0:02:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She cried all day yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.84,0:02:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving Miss Claire\Nto you now, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:24.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll be lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.56,0:02:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so, but I still lost our duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I quit as her maid, so there's\Nnothing I can do for her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really giving up just like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.84,0:02:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you ever even love\Nher in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.76,0:02:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are asking me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.54,0:02:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who started all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You took Miss Claire away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You turned tail and ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just your excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were always going to give up on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean I was always...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really think\NI'd buy your little act?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't expect her to return my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:02.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm putting her happiness first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.18,0:03:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are lies you tell\Nto protect yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:07.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is you're terrified\Nof her rejecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.06,0:03:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you run and hide and you pretend\Nit's all for her sake. You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:14.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.10,0:03:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if my love is unrequited.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a lie. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.68,0:03:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.14,0:03:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.70,0:03:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want her to love me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I want to be hers,\Nand I want her to be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.18,0:03:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want it so much, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:36.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid enough\Nto indulge in a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.36,0:03:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.80,0:03:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're both girls, and she's\Nin love with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you just cut and run, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you'll be happy keeping\Nup this farce and not even trying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:47.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made it this far, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can swallow my feelings because\Nit's what's best for Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relationships like that\Nare doomed to fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.24,0:04:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know better than anyone,\Nbecause it happened to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was someone whom I\Nloved with all my heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.42,0:04:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just as you love Claire with all of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told myself I was fine\Nso long as she was happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.48,0:04:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if we didn't end up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shoved my feelings down until\NI couldn't contain them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I made a terrible mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Considering the difference\Nin our statuses she
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would never have turned\Nme down even still i
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before long she vanished from the\Npalace and i never saw her again
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feelings that seek nothing\Nin return will always
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,become twisted the heart\Nisn't strong or pure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:44.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough to withstand them\Nwhat happened changed me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i started going to brothels\Nand disguise Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought keeping relationships\Ntransactional would prevent heartache,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for them and for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.14,0:04:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I never felt fulfilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.88,0:05:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could take it back,\Nbut I can't. It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.68,0:05:03.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.56,0:05:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what you want me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're still determined\Nto give up on Claire,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I think I'll use her for my\Namusement just like the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't please tell\Nme you're not serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have so much fun corrupting her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let You do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.50,0:05:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, what's your big plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scales at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the amor ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.72,0:05:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,measuring your feelings\Non The scales of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's rather bold, I must admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in case you've forgotten, you\Nlost and Claire Is already mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't accept this challenge unless\Nthere's something in it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I win,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll be mine as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine by me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like the fire in your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:03.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.50,0:06:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let her take Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the Academy Ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.04,0:06:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, i wasn't consulted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.84,0:06:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.52,0:06:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still won't tell us what you\Nwant, so now it's come to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something, claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.66,0:06:34.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever wondered whose feelings were
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.80,0:06:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really first measured\Non the scales of love?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it the two suitors\Nwhose love God tested?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.00,0:06:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or was it someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.32,0:06:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.78,0:06:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The audacity of those two!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My feelings are not pawns in a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.22,0:07:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for Rey, she's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would imagine she's out on a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A job?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.72,0:07:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's been accepting every monster hunting\Nquest on the Knights bulletin board
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's taking them all what in\Nthe world could she be thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.48,0:07:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another stupid magic stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.14,0:07:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I shouldn't be surprised with the\Nmeasly drop rate like point five percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.18,0:07:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to wallow in my misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.62,0:07:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know full well Princess\NManaria is capable of anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.74,0:07:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even getting her hands\Non a flower of flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.24,0:07:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my only chance at winning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.42,0:07:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.02,0:08:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told myself I could\Nnever use my knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.72,0:08:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the game to my advantage romantically.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.34,0:08:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was my rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.08,0:08:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be unfair\Nto use the circumstances
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.08,0:08:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of my reincarnation to\Nwin Miss Claire's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.66,0:08:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was wrong from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I want a future with Miss Claire,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.44,0:08:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if a happy ending with her\Nmeans more to me than anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it doesn't matter\Nwhat anyone else thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.12,0:08:46.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worry not, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way I'm giving up that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:08:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relay air!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bicycle wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stone pinning!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.38,0:09:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imagine if you could\Njust press reset on love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.58,0:09:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love her too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clare, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This year's Amour ceremony\Nseems to be a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So who are you hoping\Nwill win in your match?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.66,0:10:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rae or Princess Manaria?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As if it even matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.10,0:10:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't concern myself with fools who\Nwould treat me like some sort of trophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.78,0:10:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm a bit biased,\Nbut I hope Rey wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.92,0:10:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're taking her side\Nbecause she's your friend then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.68,0:10:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.56,0:10:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you really feel about Rey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.60,0:10:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing for me to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The commoner is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.10,0:10:31.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she's absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.04,0:10:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's done nothing but spout\Nnonsense since the moment we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She tricked my father to become my maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:41.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and she's been driving me mad\Nwith her teasing ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.34,0:10:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is utterly\Nincorrigible, reprehensible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl is simply the cheekiest\Ncommoner I have ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.08,0:10:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.72,0:10:56.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to see a smile on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.50,0:10:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if Rey does win this, will you give her\Nanother chance to serve as your maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.08,0:11:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.80,0:11:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.60,0:11:16.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One such as I could never deign\Nto beg a commoner to be my maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.52,0:11:18.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is completely out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll blame nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.80,0:11:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a heavy burden to bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I suppose I'll have\Nto hope for a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.90,0:11:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A miracle? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.24,0:11:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that makes everything\Nwork out in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like in the fairy tales\Nwe read as children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire, this is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.74,0:11:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that flower a...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.98,0:11:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a flower of flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.78,0:11:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Rae?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I deliver this poem to you, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.16,0:12:10.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My love has placed her faith in\Nme, and I shall never reject her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear to you here and now, that\NI will always be your protector.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.52,0:12:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same words she said\Nwhen we were young.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.54,0:12:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you so disheveled?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.72,0:13:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.63,0:13:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you didn't run away after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.88,0:13:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.30,0:13:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taking your butt is my\Nnumber one priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.66,0:13:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I won't let her have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor naive thing,\Nyou've shown up just to
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.00,0:13:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lose again I have a\Nflower of Flora after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no greater offering in the\Nworld but do entertain me with yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on my offering
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is this huh a twin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.10,0:13:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be some kind of joke that's\Nfor the scales of love to decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.06,0:13:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I offer the truth in my\Nheart to God's judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way Ray can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was she thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was doomed from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:36.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't even close to\Ngood enough. It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.80,0:14:43.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you have faith in Rey?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.86,0:14:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems that the win is still mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the scales!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.72,0:15:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The flower floor really lost? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.76,0:15:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.28,0:15:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A twig.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more than that. Much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Branch of Eternal Love is a rare item
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dropped by a monster\Ncalled the Entwined Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offering it unlocks an exclusive cutscene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.86,0:15:36.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a secret to all\Nbut the most hardcore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.38,0:15:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought the Flower of Flora was the\Nbest possible offering someone could give.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.82,0:15:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be fair, it was the best offering known\Nto date, so kudos on tracking it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I was able to find something\Neven better than the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't say I\Ndidn't warn you, Manaria.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rey's not someone you\Nshould ever underestimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.20,0:15:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I make jokes to hide how I feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I can't give you a\Ngrand fairy tale romance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:13.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But whether the scales of love\Nor even God acknowledges it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.66,0:16:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.86,0:16:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.76,0:16:19.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing will ever change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:22.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, and I will\Nuntil my last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.20,0:16:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please, I want to be with you, not as\Nyour maid or servant, but as your partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, looks like I lost\Nthis one fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.54,0:16:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, you really are one\Nof a kind, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.20,0:16:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.80,0:16:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind, sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.82,0:16:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But to tell you the truth, I've been\Nafter Rae from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.80,0:16:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, so you weren't trying to steal Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.92,0:16:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were messing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.75,0:16:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The look on your face was so\Nadorable, I couldn't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.24,0:17:08.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from me, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is exactly what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:12.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so cute when you're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just makes me want you even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:17.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gray is mine and I won't let you\Ntake her from me, do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.34,0:17:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.62,0:17:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, care to repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.64,0:17:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.42,0:17:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.33,0:17:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said I knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I ordered you to get out of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.08,0:17:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are in a very public space!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.66,0:17:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No can do, my love cup rendezvous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.22,0:17:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.28,0:17:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shots are not you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All this behavior is undignified!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.90,0:17:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does this mean we'll\Nbe together forever now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was certainly\Nan unexpected development.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:18:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Manaria, forgive my impudence,\Nbut this contest has been decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed it has.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love you too, Remy!
