Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.79,0:19:12.18,ed_eng_12_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how much I say it, it'll never, ever be enough!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.18,0:19:13.21,ed_eng_12_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I love you so much!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.21,0:19:16.25,ed_eng_12_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Choice or no choice, I'd still tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,joining us.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.25,0:19:18.86,ed_eng_12_pink,Rae/Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Joy, soul-search, and feel remorse...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.87,0:19:20.21,ed_eng_12_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Bow down to me!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.21,0:19:21.00,ed_eng_12_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}You see,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.00,0:19:22.71,ed_eng_12_pink,Rae/Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Even if it's for a minute or just a second,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.71,0:19:23.67,ed_eng_12_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I won't let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.71,0:19:23.67,ed_eng_12_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)\3c&HF97107&}I wanna be by your side!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.52,0:19:42.69,ed_eng_12_pink,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}I teach you a lesson!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.52,0:19:42.69,ed_eng_12_pink,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)\3c&HF97107&}My wish comes true!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.06,0:19:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you returning to Seuss so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.22,0:19:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, but the First\NPrince passed away suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the rite of succession\Nhas been moved up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.78,0:20:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I'm afraid I need to return\Nto my family's dreadful feud.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.92,0:20:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, Rey shot me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.76,0:20:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What better way to recover\Nthan a fight for the throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.38,0:20:08.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But mark my words, I'll come back\Nto bother you when it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.46,0:20:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or you could not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, Rey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.39,0:20:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're being very rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.36,0:20:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't soon forget how much\Nfun I had with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither will I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.75,0:20:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get gone, bewitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really did put your\Nfoot where your mouth is?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.02,0:20:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is not the proper\Nway to treat a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, believe me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just saving the princess\Ntreatment for my princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are closer than two peas in a pod.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm too effective for my own good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.00,0:20:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I wonder\Nif that was her goal all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.96,0:20:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that she\Nplayed the bad guy the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.66,0:20:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time just to push Miss Claire\Nand me closer together?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.84,0:20:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold the phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if that's true, there must have\Nbeen a more painless way to go about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.10,0:20:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick request.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind if I borrow Ray just one last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.84,0:21:09.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And like a gust of\Nwind, she came and went.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:12.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that that's over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.66,0:21:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.22,0:21:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that matters is that\NMiss Claire is happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.86,0:21:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't cry, Loretta.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.30,0:21:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we still love each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.80,0:21:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True love takes many forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.68,0:21:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You love birds have our full support.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.38,0:21:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.50,0:21:29.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world are\Nyou all talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're talking about you and Ray Aren't\Nyou two gonna invite us to your wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.06,0:21:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.32,0:21:41.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, Claire Francois, a commoner's bride No,\NI think I'd prefer to call Rey my bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.97,0:21:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I take it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rey, I must ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, ask away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.56,0:21:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.22,0:22:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew of a secret offering that\Nsurpassed the flower of Flora.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I hear you neutralized an unknown\Npoison from the Nur Empire as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you acquire that knowledge?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:09.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.96,0:22:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a spy sent by the Empire? I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you swear?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.34,0:22:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear to Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.72,0:22:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.08,0:22:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My only allegiance is to Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.94,0:22:38.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my only mission is to stop the\Ntragedy that awaits in her future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.84,0:22:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You swear to Miss Claire, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, coming from you that means\Nmore than an oath to God ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.66,0:22:52.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,possibly could.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.57,0:22:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you promise to look\Nafter Claire for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.14,0:22:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as good as done.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.08,0:23:07.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say it again, pretty please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still go as quick as I tap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.26,0:23:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.92,0:23:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.22,0:23:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me more about how I'm yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.62,0:23:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're getting ahead of yourself again,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.22,0:23:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray after all we just started
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.18,0:23:18.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,started calling me by my\Nname and what if I did
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.36,0:23:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Famous Claire, I love you.\NI couldn't quite hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.50,0:23:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with you and\NI don't care who knows it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.54,0:23:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.72,0:23:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.12,0:23:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help me, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.03,0:23:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my way for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.14,0:23:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shame, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.05,0:23:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your points out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:53.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no. No, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.88,0:23:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.79,0:23:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People are scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.12,0:23:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.03,0:23:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you.

